{"messages":[{"text":"🇺🇦 Rusia ataca con drones cerca del paso Dorohusk-Yahodyn, en la frontera de Ucrania con Polonia, y obliga a interrumpir temporalmente el cruce.\n🌶️ Moscú llama objetivo militar a un paso fronterizo: la escalada también viene con GPS.","buttons":[{"label":"Abrir en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%BA%F0%9F%87%A6%20Rusia%20ataca%20con%20drones%20cerca%20del%20paso%20Dorohusk-Yahodyn%2C%20en%20la%20frontera%20de%20Ucrania%20con%20Polonia%2C%20y%20obliga%20a%20interrumpir%20temporalmente%20el%20cruce.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Mosc%C3%BA%20llama%20objetivo%20militar%20a%20un%20paso%20fronterizo%3A%20la%20escalada%20tambi%C3%A9n%20viene%20con%20GPS."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 1 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%BA%F0%9F%87%A6%20Rusia%20ataca%20con%20drones%20cerca%20del%20paso%20Dorohusk-Yahodyn%2C%20en%20la%20frontera%20de%20Ucrania%20con%20Polonia%2C%20y%20obliga%20a%20interrumpir%20temporalmente%20el%20cruce.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Rusia%20acerca%20los%20drones%20a%20Polonia%20y%20luego%20preguntar%C3%A1%20qui%C3%A9n%20est%C3%A1%20escalando."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 2 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%BA%F0%9F%87%A6%20Rusia%20ataca%20con%20drones%20cerca%20del%20paso%20Dorohusk-Yahodyn%2C%20en%20la%20frontera%20de%20Ucrania%20con%20Polonia%2C%20y%20obliga%20a%20interrumpir%20temporalmente%20el%20cruce.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Putin%20sigue%20probando%20d%C3%B3nde%20acaba%20Ucrania%20y%20empieza%20la%20paciencia%20de%20la%20OTAN."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 3 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%BA%F0%9F%87%A6%20Rusia%20ataca%20con%20drones%20cerca%20del%20paso%20Dorohusk-Yahodyn%2C%20en%20la%20frontera%20de%20Ucrania%20con%20Polonia%2C%20y%20obliga%20a%20interrumpir%20temporalmente%20el%20cruce.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20El%20Kremlin%20prueba%20la%20frontera%20polaca%20como%20quien%20tantea%20una%20alarma%3A%20a%20ver%20cu%C3%A1nto%20tarda%20en%20son